                              "desc":  "TOP LEFT iceKingdom: fully snow-covered ground, snow-loaded trees, icy blue rock ledges, creek mostly frozen pale blue with a narrow visible flowing-water channel, cleared pale footpaths. TOP RIGHT volcano: replace ENTIRE right creek water with flowing orange-red LAVA, dark basalt banks, charred trees at perimeter, ash-covered dark ground and cracked basalt field clearing; no blue water anywhere. BOTTOM LEFT cherryBlossom: mature pink sakura trees instead of green border canopy, settled pink petals across grassy terrain and paths, clear pale blue creek. BOTTOM RIGHT goldenHarvest: golden grass and autumn amber orchard border, ochre paths, wheat tufts restricted to perimeter, blue creek."
                          },
                          {
                              "key":  "terrain-sheet-2",
                              "ids":  [
                                          "valentine",
                                          "halloween",
                                          "christmas",
                                          "whiteDay"
                                      ],
                              "desc":  "TOP LEFT valentine: rose bushes and pink flowering trees at border, soft blush meadow, cream footpaths, naturally blue creek. TOP RIGHT halloween: autumn orange and purple trees, pumpkin clusters ONLY at perimeter, muted olive field and dusky paths, dark teal creek, readable dusk lighting. BOTTOM LEFT christmas: thick continuous snow covering all ground including field clearing, snow-laden evergreens at border with a few red berries, cleared snow paths and icy partially frozen creek, NO buildings or Christmas props. BOTTOM RIGHT whiteDay: ivory white flowering trees and white flowers only at borders, cool mint meadow with pale paths, pale blue creek, restrained elegant spring palette."
                          },
                          {
                              "key":  "terrain-sheet-3",
                              "ids":  [
                                          "springMeadow",
                                          "galaxyNight",
                                          "ocean",
                                          "bubbleField"
                                      ],
                              "desc":  "TOP LEFT springMeadow: fresh green meadow and mixed red yellow pink tulips around perimeter, warm dirt paths, blue creek. TOP RIGHT galaxyNight: midnight indigo and violet forest, moonlit dark teal quiet meadow and pale moonlit paths, creek dark blue with a few pixel reflections, no actual stars painted over playable ground. BOTTOM LEFT ocean: transform woodland setting to coastal palms and seaside shrubs at same border positions, sandy beige ground and paths, existing right creek course becomes a turquoise tidal channel with sandy rock banks, no additional water covering central field. BOTTOM RIGHT bubbleField: lavender-flowered wetland border, mint green grassy central clearing, pale pebble footpaths, lilypads only at edges of same right channel, teal clear water; no baked floating bubbles."
                          }
